{"version":1,"key":"card:609","content":{"id":609,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7a2224d6-4d60-4f5c-8e26-b804064f9662","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 TypeScript 枚举中有一种常量枚举，与一般枚举声明不同在于使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"const"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行修饰"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"a09a66f2-2dac-421c-95e9-9714ded29075","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"68bace93-5a7c-4979-9283-29f82ed5e9df","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const enum Value {\n  A = 1,\n  B = 2,\n  C = \"Hello\"\n}","collabId":"08cbf10c-f9b3-4935-8749-05fdef15e129","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a15e41ad-5f36-4782-968d-4457104a900c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么在使用上与普通枚举不同之处在哪里呢？为了回答这个问题，我们看下它们编译后的产物有何不同。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"814e3a68-7cca-4a60-b45e-b7f740c5e67e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先看一下普通枚举"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"056e888f-ce80-400e-b302-036bbdcadb92","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"223b87d0-bf5f-4814-bf7a-3de7f4082548","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"enum Value {\n  A = 1,\n  B = 2,\n  C = \"Hello\"\n}\nconsole.log(Value.A);","collabId":"f79c57a3-f09b-4512-ba8c-d0188febb216","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"c537fc38-aae7-4b52-885e-6e67e91909a4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8752eddb-9fa7-4144-8967-3297015ef536","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"var Value;\n(function (Value) {\n    Value[Value[\"A\"] = 1] = \"A\";\n    Value[Value[\"B\"] = 2] = \"B\";\n    Value[\"C\"] = \"Hello\";\n})(Value || (Value = {}));\nconsole.log(Value.A);","collabId":"bf602031-a719-4802-b52d-bb7dbf7e30c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce710d70-1732-441d-9bb6-1ec13b721b4d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"普通枚举编译后的产物有两个特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"58282eb0-7523-4582-954a-7c315b35a6cf","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47ec03cd-1cd7-45e2-bf59-57d799d1194e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d66d781-a7d8-4b43-84f2-f940b44d7e49","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"枚举被编译为了对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a83a26e2-c91b-4945-82db-ac29ba557b55","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f55e9067-a773-4dbc-a788-fd0877866bf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果枚举的值是数字，那么可以进行双向访问，即不仅可以通过键访问到值，还可以通过值访问到键"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"a46e3bfd-a876-44e8-9195-144a1d548107","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"58c3bfca-e463-4573-b2e6-cee24a1346e9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Value.A = 1\nValue[1] = \"A\"","collabId":"2ce38f87-2068-46a4-b5ec-9f7bc8e9b9d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2e13e7d-9ae4-46f6-8e68-9153a0c6065e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来看下常量枚举会编译成了什么"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"4e3d9a22-c474-45a8-b2dd-6ddabfb2abf1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1e36c664-0315-4a24-91fc-72d844bfddfd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const enum Value {\n  A = 1,\n  B = 2,\n  C = \"Hello\"\n}","collabId":"d6d3d029-1721-4cf0-ba95-396a2df16175","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"361996cb-49f0-42b3-be4c-48e9a9653cfe","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9e3d90e0-cdce-485c-9c2b-9fef4a136aec","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(1 /* Value.A */);","collabId":"f92cd400-6bf9-489c-829d-ae0fd5334fc4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"96406aca-2412-4e34-9548-39b506f83a34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到，编译后的产物根本没有枚举这个东西在，所有用到枚举的地方都被直接编译为了枚举对应的常量值。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7ba9eb45-cb7f-4c55-9c6c-dfdc149a3100","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据以上观察，可以得出有一下几点不同："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a54d43f8-d7f4-47dc-9cfc-498b650b8fc4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4ba258ff-ffda-4ab7-9408-36cd509a3008","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5c01010-9bad-4192-be4c-821a02f447f8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"访问性，因为常量枚举没有被编译为对象，因此也不存在双向访问的可能，即无法通过值去访问到枚举的键"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2f973dca-a917-44c8-8835-c3a8f82e1dbb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"87b5707e-10ff-46cc-8629-152fbbf51985","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"计算值，在普通枚举中，枚举值可以不在编译期确定，可以动态计算得出，但是在常量枚举中，因为需要在编译期就要确定枚举值，这样才能在使用的地方替换为具体的值，因此在常量枚举中无法使用动态值"}]}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/常量枚举","概念对比"],"createTime":1753695456937,"updateTime":1753696482725,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753696482725}}